.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Unlike .gitignore, dockerignore patterns are anchored at the build context
# root, so the bare `.env` above does NOT cover token/.env. Solana key material
# must never reach an image layer — the mint/presale/LP authority lives here.
**/.env
!**/.env.example
**/.keys/
**/*keypair*.json
**/id.json
target/
.git
.github
.gitignore
data/
logs/
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
node_modules
*.tar.gz
*.egg-info
demo/
docs/
website/demo-recording.*
*.md
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE

# Bulk that COPY . . was shipping into the image layer. `demo/` and `docs/`
# were already excluded; these are the rest, measured:
#   ollama/            ~48 MB of .jsonl fine-tune corpora (33 MB in one file)
#   benchmark/         61 gzipped OHLCV fixtures, build inputs for backtests
#   tests/             the suite does not run inside the runtime image
#   agentbench/, evidence/, marketing/, site/, playbooks/  reports and assets
# None is read at runtime; all of it was in every pull.
ollama/
tests/
agentbench/
evidence/
marketing/
site/
app/test/
website/*.mp4
website/*.webm
AUDIT_REPORT*.md

# NOT excluded, though they look like obvious bulk — both are read at runtime,
# and checking that before deleting is the difference between a smaller image
# and a broken feature:
#   benchmark/           11 MB. bot/backtest/snapshot.benchmark_root() reads it
#                        and bot/api/lab.py runs the Strategy Lab's backtests
#                        against it in production. It is a build INPUT, which is
#                        why CLAUDE.md insists it stays tracked.
#   app/public/mascot/   5.8 MB of .glb, served to browsers at /mascot/agent.glb
#                        by app/public/js/mascot3d.js. Dropping them leaves the
#                        agent viewer stuck on "Summoning the agent…".
#   playbooks/           strategy definitions; small, and loaded by name.
